{"summary":"The classic Dominoes game online and offline. Enjoy your pastime time with us!","description":"Have fun with this great and classic board game: Dominos!\n\nCreate private matches and play with your friends online, try to defeat your opponents with strategy, reasoning and a little bit of luck..\n\nDominos Jogatina is an app for Dominoes fans! With it, you can have endless fun whenever and wherever you want.\n\nCheck out its main features:\n- Play with bots, or with friends and others Domino's players: Play Dominoes online with your Facebook friends or challenge others players from anywhere in the world! If you want, you can train offline with our bots too.\n- 4 different modes: Choose your favorite Domino mode:Turbo, Draw, All Fives and Block.\n- Dominoes game free with 2 or 4 players in our Multiplayer Online or Singleplayer Offline Modes: Choose if you will create a match with just two players or two teams.\n\nOther Domino's features:\n- 3 difficulty levels.\n- Customize the board and the tiles from the game.\n- Statistics from your matches.\n\nIf you like board games like Checkers, Chess, Ludo and Backgammon, you will love Dominos Jogatina. What are you waiting for? Get the tiles and score to victory.\n\nDownload for free this classic board game now!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9j4fDGUV7wI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CUCf5mcP7XjEc3hdwXGeo85TqFHPvfliG6XCR6sernkVKLzVyfx3gDB7LPbSVA7yWbx8pKWwKSjsOQNPQ6_R","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vHxCxbBcOXB3Zt1qhDC9OBc2nAlQgIWgYzgl9Dyls70B03sWc_wHmK3ofTjPhOOCas197Ig_2UWaT0qHOw2n9f0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J4ewVJQuwh4K61SWteotLZGyhBogKIU6MKoRMPvlvHNJlYqYB5aNLIy4xqwMR_3OGejYNQfl2PdhiclQU8mj1ho","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CR1nHOxmX1wgrnkt70tEGE27hXfVguI1JvTlgWtpOyCpDvi2MMk-x531iZTsanWiSsnqHF5XsRbm5R4lbkLw_Q","https://play-lh.goog